 "notes": [
  "Format Premiere - Tatooine: posted 24 June 2001, before Coruscant, and the list has no Coruscant-set card.",
  "Starting cards as posted under 'Starting7': Rebel Strike Team / Garrison Destroyed, Endor, Endor: Rebel Landing Site (Forest), Heading For The Medical Frigate, The Shield Is Down!, Insurrection, Strike Planning; they count toward the 60. Three Effects start and the post names none as the starting Effect, so no starting Effect is set.",
  "Total 59, as published: the 'Characters19' section lists 18 cards (Luke Skywalker, Rebel Scout x2 plus 16 others). The strategy also describes Corporal Delevar, who is not in the list and is not added.",
  "The 'Weapons/Devices8' and 'Epic Events/Podracers2' section headers were mis-parsed as cards and removed.",
  "Posted 'RST/GD' dested Rebel Strike Team / Garrison Destroyed; 'Endor' dested the Light Endor system; 'Luke Skywalker,RS' dested Luke Skywalker, Rebel Scout; 'Corp. Junkin' dested Sergeant Junkin (the strategy says Junkin adds 1 to the Epic Event).",
  "Posted 'Qui-Gon' dested Qui-Gon Jinn and 'Qui-Gon's Stick' dested Qui-Gon Jinn's Lightsaber; 'Obi with Stick' dested Obi-Wan With Lightsaber; 'KFC' dested Kal'Falnl C'ndros; 'Twas Khaa' dested Tawss Khaa; 'Bouush' dested Boushh; 'Orrimarko' dested Orrimaarko.",
  "Posted 'OOC & TT' dested Out Of Commission & Transmission Terminated; 'Sorry About the Mess & Blaster Pro.' dested Sorry About The Mess & Blaster Proficiency; 'Don't Get @#$%y' dested Don't Get Cocky; 'Merc. Armor' dested Mercenary Armor; 'Anakin's Pod.' dested Anakin's Podracer."
